{"type": "tableHeader","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "Description"}]}]}]},{"type": "tableRow","content": [{"type": "tableCell","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "Create"}]}]},{"type": "tableCell","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "work.change.create","marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]},{"type": "tableCell","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "Creates a change from a title, urgency, and optional description, impact, priority, and assignee. Writes the new change id, its human-readable number, and the status after creation."}]}]}]},{"type": "tableRow","content": [{"type": "tableCell","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "Update"}]}]},{"type": "tableCell","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "work.change.update","marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]},{"type": "tableCell","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "Updates the change identified by target_id from the process context. Optional inputs set status, approval status, priority, assignee, and a work note. Writes the change id and the status after the update."}]}]}]},{"type": "tableRow","content": [{"type": "tableCell","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "Delete"}]}]},{"type": "tableCell","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "work.change.delete","marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]},{"type": "tableCell","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "Deletes the change identified by target_id from the process context. Writes the id of the deleted change."}]}]}]}]},{"type": "heading","attrs": {"level": 4},"content": [{"type": "text","text": "Service order"}]},{"type": "table","content": [{"type": "tableRow","content": [{"type": "tableHeader","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "Procedure"}]}]},{"type": "tableHeader","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "Code"}]}]},{"type": "tableHeader","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "Description"}]}]}]},{"type": "tableRow","content": [{"type": "tableCell","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "Update"}]}]},{"type": "tableCell","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "catalog.service_order.update","marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]},{"type": "tableCell","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "Updates the catalog service order identified by target_id from the process context. Optional inputs set the title, the description, urgency, and impact. Writes the order id."}]}]}]},{"type": "tableRow","content": [{"type": "tableCell","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "Delete"}]}]},{"type": "tableCell","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "catalog.service_order.delete","marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]},{"type": "tableCell","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "Deletes the catalog service order identified by target_id from the process context. Writes the id of the deleted order."}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"type": "details","attrs": {"open": false,"lineColor": "blue"},"content": [{"type": "detailsSummary","content": [{"type": "phosphorIcon","attrs": {"iconName": "PhGlobe","weight": "regular","size": 16}},{"type": "text","text": " External activity"}]},{"type": "detailsContent","content": [{"type": "heading","attrs": {"level": 3},"content": [{"type": "text","text": "Purpose"}]},{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "An external activity calls another system through a connector. The token waits until the worker finishes the call."}]},{"type": "heading","attrs": {"level": 3},"content": [{"type": "text","text": "Notation"}]},{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "phosphorIcon","attrs": {"iconName": "PhGlobe","weight": "regular","size": 16}},{"type": "text","text": " A rectangle with a globe, with one incoming sequence flow and one outgoing sequence flow."}]},{"type": "heading","attrs": {"level": 3},"content": [{"type": "text","text": "Token arrival"}]},{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "When a token arrives on the incoming sequence flow, the call is queued for the worker and the token waits."}]},{"type": "heading","attrs": {"level": 3},"content": [{"type": "text","text": "Outgoing sequence flow"}]},{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "When the worker answers, the result is written to the process context and control continues along the outgoing sequence flow. A failed call becomes an incident."}]},{"type": "heading","attrs": {"level": 3},"content": [{"type": "text","text": "Sequence flows"}]},{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "Exactly one incoming sequence flow and exactly one outgoing sequence flow."}]},{"type": "heading","attrs": {"level": 3},"content": [{"type": "text","text": "Properties"}]},{"type": "bulletList","content": [{"type": "listItem","content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "Connector, resource, and method come from the chosen procedure."}]}]},{"type": "listItem","content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "Inputs are set in the inspector, as a literal or from the process context."}]}]}]},{"type": "heading","attrs": {"level": 3},"content": [{"type": "text","text": "Process context"}]},{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "The answer from the outside call is written to "},{"type": "text","text": "context.activities.<id>","marks": [{"type": "code"}]},{"type": "text","text": "."}]},{"type": "heading","attrs": {"level": 3},"content": [{"type": "text","text": "Procedures"}]},{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "Values are set in the inspector, as a literal or from the process context."}]},{"type": "heading","attrs": {"level": 4},"content": [{"type": "text","text": "Webhook endpoint"}]},{"type": "table","content": [{"type": "tableRow","content": [{"type": "tableHeader","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "Procedure"}]}]},{"type": "tableHeader","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "Code"}]}]},{"type": "tableHeader","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "Description"}]}]}]},{"type": "tableRow","content": [{"type": "tableCell","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "POST request"}]}]},{"type": "tableCell","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "http.webhook.post","marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]},{"type": "tableCell","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "Sends an HTTP POST request to an external webhook URL with an optional payload, Authorization header, and timeout. Writes the HTTP status code, the response body, and the round-trip duration."}]}]}]},{"type": "tableRow","content": [{"type": "tableCell","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "GET request"}]}]},{"type": "tableCell","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "http.webhook.get","marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]},{"type": "tableCell","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "Sends an HTTP GET request to an external webhook URL with an optional Authorization header and timeout. Writes the HTTP status code, the response body, and the round-trip duration."}]}]}]},{"type": "tableRow","content": [{"type": "tableCell","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "PUT request"}]}]},{"type": "tableCell","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "http.webhook.put","marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]},{"type": "tableCell","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "Sends an HTTP PUT request to an external webhook URL with an optional payload, Authorization header, and timeout. Writes the HTTP status code, the response body, and the round-trip duration."}]}]}]},{"type": "tableRow","content": [{"type": "tableCell","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "PATCH request"}]}]},{"type": "tableCell","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "http.webhook.patch","marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]},{"type": "tableCell","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "Sends an HTTP PATCH request to an external webhook URL with an optional payload, Authorization header, and timeout. Writes the HTTP status code, the response body, and the round-trip duration."}]}]}]},{"type": "tableRow","content": [{"type": "tableCell","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "DELETE request"}]}]},{"type": "tableCell","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "http.webhook.delete","marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]},{"type": "tableCell","attrs": {"colspan": 1,"rowspan": 1,"colwidth": null},"content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "Sends an HTTP DELETE request to an external webhook URL with an optional Authorization header and timeout. Writes the HTTP status code, the response body, and the round-trip duration."}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"type": "details","attrs": {"open": false,"lineColor": "error"},"content": [{"type": "detailsSummary","content": [{"type": "phosphorIcon","attrs": {"iconName": "PhX","weight": "regular","size": 16}},{"type": "text","text": " Exclusive gateway"}]},{"type": "detailsContent","content": [{"type": "heading","attrs": {"level": 3},"content": [{"type": "text","text": "Purpose"}]},{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "An exclusive gateway sends the token down only one path. It does no work of its own. On a split it reads the process data and picks one sequence flow."}]},{"type": "heading","attrs": {"level": 3},"content": [{"type": "text","text": "Notation"}]},{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "phosphorIcon","attrs": {"iconName": "PhX","weight": "regular","size": 16}},{"type": "text","text": " A diamond with a cross. A split has one incoming sequence flow and two or more outgoing sequence flows. A join has two or more incoming sequence flows and one outgoing sequence flow."}]},{"type": "heading","attrs": {"level": 3},"content": [{"type": "text","text": "Token arrival"}]},{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "When a token arrives on a split, conditions are checked in order. The token takes the first match, or the flow with no condition when none match. When a token arrives on a join, it passes straight through. This gateway does not wait for the other branches."}]},{"type": "heading","attrs": {"level": 3},"content": [{"type": "text","text": "Outgoing sequence flow"}]},{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "Control continues on exactly one outgoing sequence flow."}]},{"type": "heading","attrs": {"level": 3},"content": [{"type": "text","text": "Sequence flows"}]},{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "A split has one incoming sequence flow and two or more outgoing sequence flows. A join has two or more incoming sequence flows and one outgoing sequence flow. The join is the same type as its paired split."}]},{"type": "heading","attrs": {"level": 3},"content": [{"type": "text","text": "Properties"}]},{"type": "bulletList","content": [{"type": "listItem","content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "On a split, every outgoing branch but one has a condition: variable, operator, and value."}]}]},{"type": "listItem","content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "One branch has no condition. That unconditional default flow is marked with a slash (/)."}]}]},{"type": "listItem","content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "Max loops defaults to 10 and guards against an endless loop."}]}]}]},{"type": "heading","attrs": {"level": 3},"content": [{"type": "text","text": "Process context"}]},{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "The chosen path and how many times the gateway was passed are written to "},{"type": "text","text": "context.gateways.<id>","marks": [{"type": "code"}]},{"type": "text","text": "."}]}]}]},{"type": "details","attrs": {"open": false,"lineColor": "error"},"content": [{"type": "detailsSummary","content": [{"type": "phosphorIcon","attrs": {"iconName": "PhCircle","weight": "regular","size": 16}},{"type": "text","text": " Inclusive gateway"}]},{"type": "detailsContent","content": [{"type": "heading","attrs": {"level": 3},"content": [{"type": "text","text": "Purpose"}]},{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "An inclusive gateway starts one or more branches whose conditions are true."}]},{"type": "heading","attrs": {"level": 3},"content": [{"type": "text","text": "Notation"}]},{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "phosphorIcon","attrs": {"iconName": "PhCircle","weight": "regular","size": 16}},{"type": "text","text": " A diamond with a circle. A split has one incoming sequence flow and two or more outgoing sequence flows. A join has two or more incoming sequence flows and one outgoing sequence flow."}]},{"type": "heading","attrs": {"level": 3},"content": [{"type": "text","text": "Token arrival"}]},{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "When a token arrives on a split, every branch whose condition is true receives its own token. If none match, the token takes the branch with no condition. When tokens arrive on a join, the gateway waits only for the branches that actually started, then lets one token continue."}]},{"type": "heading","attrs": {"level": 3},"content": [{"type": "text","text": "Outgoing sequence flow"}]},{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "On a split, control continues on every matching outgoing sequence flow. After the join, one token continues."}]},{"type": "heading","attrs": {"level": 3},"content": [{"type": "text","text": "Sequence flows"}]},{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "A split has one incoming sequence flow and two or more outgoing sequence flows. A join has two or more incoming sequence flows and one outgoing sequence flow. The join is the same type as its paired split."}]},{"type": "heading","attrs": {"level": 3},"content": [{"type": "text","text": "Properties"}]},{"type": "bulletList","content": [{"type": "listItem","content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "Every outgoing branch but one has a condition. The branch without a condition is the unconditional default flow, marked with a slash (/)."}]}]},{"type": "listItem","content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "Max loops defaults to 10. Past that limit, the token becomes an incident."}]}]}]},{"type": "heading","attrs": {"level": 3},"content": [{"type": "text","text": "Process context"}]},{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "The last chosen path and the pass counts are written to "},{"type": "text","text": "context.gateways.<id>","marks": [{"type": "code"}]},{"type": "text","text": "."}]}]}]},{"type": "details","attrs": {"open": false,"lineColor": "error"},"content": [{"type": "detailsSummary","content": [{"type": "phosphorIcon","attrs": {"iconName": "PhPlus","weight": "regular","size": 16}},{"type": "text","text": " Parallel gateway"}]},{"type": "detailsContent","content": [{"type": "heading","attrs": {"level": 3},"content": [{"type": "text","text": "Purpose"}]},{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "A parallel gateway starts every outgoing branch at once and joins them again. The sequence flows have no conditions."}]},{"type": "heading","attrs": {"level": 3},"content": [{"type": "text","text": "Notation"}]},{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "phosphorIcon","attrs": {"iconName": "PhPlus","weight": "regular","size": 16}},{"type": "text","text": " A diamond with a plus. A split has one incoming sequence flow and two or more outgoing sequence flows. A join has two or more incoming sequence flows and one outgoing sequence flow."}]},{"type": "heading","attrs": {"level": 3},"content": [{"type": "text","text": "Token arrival"}]},{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "When a token arrives on a split, each outgoing sequence flow receives its own token and they run at the same time. When tokens arrive on a join, the gateway waits for a token on every incoming sequence flow."}]},{"type": "heading","attrs": {"level": 3},"content": [{"type": "text","text": "Outgoing sequence flow"}]},{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "On a split, control continues on every outgoing sequence flow at once. When a token has arrived from every branch, one token continues."}]},{"type": "heading","attrs": {"level": 3},"content": [{"type": "text","text": "Sequence flows"}]},{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "A split has one incoming sequence flow and two or more outgoing sequence flows. A join has two or more incoming sequence flows and one outgoing sequence flow. The join is the same type as its paired split."}]},{"type": "heading","attrs": {"level": 3},"content": [{"type": "text","text": "Properties"}]},{"type": "bulletList","content": [{"type": "listItem","content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "There are no conditions and no default flow."}]}]},{"type": "listItem","content": [{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "Max loops defaults to 10 and guards against a loop."}]}]}]},{"type": "heading","attrs": {"level": 3},"content": [{"type": "text","text": "Process context"}]},{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "text","text": "How many times the gateway was passed is written to "},{"type": "text","text": "context.gateways.<id>","marks": [{"type": "code"}]},{"type": "text","text": "."}]}]}]},{"type": "heading","attrs": {"level": 2},"content": [{"type": "text","text": "Related articles"}]},{"type": "paragraph","content": [{"type": "entityLink","attrs": {"entityType": "kb_article","entityId": "e1c10000-0000-4000-8000-00000000004e","label": "kba-sy1057 — BPMN basics: reading and building a process","meta": {"treeId": "e1b10000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001","treeName": "HELP KB","shortId": "kba-sy1057","status": "published","articleTypeCode": "wiki"}}}]}]}}$kb_a050_en$::jsonb,
